# Heavy C/C++ builds whose unpacked tree carries the version in its name:
# without the rename every bump is a 100 % ccache miss (see
# bashrc.d/55-srcdir-nover.sh). Verified 2026-11-22: libzip built twice under
# two version numbers, 196/196 hits with the hook against 68/196 without;
# qtwebengine 6.11.3 configure writes only the version-less path to build.ninja.
# The others are enabled on the same mechanism and not yet built with it:
# on trouble, comment the line out, nothing else depends on it.
# Not listed on purpose: other Qt/KDE modules (Qt's version header is in every
# file), gcc (bootstraps with itself), python (PGO), boost (b2), live -9999.
dev-qt/qtwebengine          srcdir-nover.conf
net-libs/webkit-gtk         srcdir-nover.conf
media-libs/opencv           srcdir-nover.conf
net-libs/nodejs             srcdir-nover.conf
app-office/libreoffice      srcdir-nover.conf
www-client/firefox          srcdir-nover.conf
dev-lang/spidermonkey       srcdir-nover.conf
media-libs/mesa             srcdir-nover.conf
media-video/ffmpeg          srcdir-nover.conf
app-emulation/qemu          srcdir-nover.conf
media-gfx/gimp              srcdir-nover.conf
llvm-core/llvm              srcdir-nover.conf
llvm-core/clang             srcdir-nover.conf
app-emulation/wine-staging  srcdir-nover.conf
app-emulation/virtualbox    srcdir-nover.conf
